= Historical Resigns

# reference: Evans, Ellen L. “Adam Stegerwald and the Role of the Christian Trade Unions in the Weimar Republic.” The Catholic Historical Review 59, no. 4 (1974): 602–26.

Historical has chosen to resign from leadership of the Liberal Democratic Party.

- @natsuki: The Leadership will be given to Natsuki.

@natsuki
on-arrival: z_party_leader = "Kaas"

Natsuki has been selected as the chairman of the Liberal Democratic Party. She seems to represent a rightward turn from Historical, and will preside over a Liberal Democratic Party less inclined to compromise with the left
